# CI: add GitHub secret REACT_APP_FIREBASE_API_KEY, then add an `env:` block to the
# `npm run build` step in .github/workflows/firebase-hosting-*.yml (see Firebase docs).
# Pushing workflow edits needs a token with the `workflow` scope.

